    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>POISON SAVE SOUL UNLIVING-GHOUL</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 8</p>\n<p>Your bite and claws carry a grave-stilling toxin that locks living muscle in place.</p>\n<p>When you inflict a critical injury with your Bite or Claws, the target must attempt a Fortitude save with the following results:</p>\n<p>Success the target is unaffected.</p>\n<p>Partial the target is slowed 1 for 1 round.</p>\n<p>Failure the target is paralyzed for 1 round.</p>\n<p>Fumble the target is paralyzed for 1 minute and may attempt a new Fortitude save at the end of each of its turns to end the paralysis.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: a critical injury with your Bite or Ghoul Claws makes the target save (Fortitude, your Level DC) — Partial slowed 1 for 1 round; Failure paralysed for 1 round; Fumble paralysed for 1 minute with a new save at the end of each of its turns.</p>",
